SUMMARY:South Howard Flood Relief Project Open House
LOCATION:Bayshore Baptist Church 3111 West Morrison Avenue Tampa \, FL 336
 29 United States
DESCRIPTION:COMING UP: Join us for a South Howard Flood Relief Project Ope
 n House Meeting We hope youre able to join us for a South Howard Flood Rel
 ief Project OPEN HOUSE on Tuesday\, August 11th\, from 6 - 8 PM at Bayshor
 e Baptist Church. This is another great opportunity for residents\, busine
 sses\, and stakeholders to connect directly with the design-build team wor
 king on the project. Stop by to learn more about whats being planned\, see
  renderings\, share your feedback\, and have your questions answered one-o
 n-one by the experts. Well see you there! To learn more\, visit: SHstormwa
 ter.com (https:shstormwater.com) \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node
 /193081
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/193081
END:VEVENT
